      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">1. Flattened Pole</span></span></span><br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">peripheral press fit</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">2. 3mm cylindrical extension</span></span><br>\n demonstrated increased jump distance compared to traditional hemispherical shells<sup>5</sup></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">3. Peripheral fixation</span></span><br>\n regional 3-point raised fixation</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">4. Ti + HA dual coating</span></span><br>\n designed to support secondary fixation</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">5. Forged stainless steel</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">6. Poly inner diameter (ID)</span></span><br>\n 28mm head starting at 47mm cup</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">7. Poly outer diameter (OD)</span></span><br>\n 6mm smaller than the cup OD</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">8. Groove pattern</span></span><br>\n promotes stability when polymerized<sup>6</sup></span></p>\n",
